e-actor	f:Description	Description: a person who buys. Rationale: drives the whole flow.\n\nINFO: Info panel text.\nNOTE: Note panel text.\nTIP: Tip panel text.\nWARNING: Warning panel text.\nOpen question: custom panel from rules.\n\n<#>An untitled note panel.</#>\n\nLabels: #risk #deprecated #todo #new [[security]] #internal-not-a-label #rsik\n\nDeadline is a styled keyword.\n\n- bullet one\n  continued line\n* bullet two\n1. numbered one\n2. numbered two\n\n**bold** and *italic*, but select * and 2*3 stay.\n[the spec](https://example.com/spec) and a bare link https://example.com/a?b=1&c=2 and [ORDERS] alone.\n\n| Column A | Column B |\n|---|---|\n| a1 | b1 |\n| a2 | b2 |\n\n| not | a table |\n\n```java\nclass Hello { }\n```\n\n<code lang="python">print("hi")</code>\n\nRefs: [[ref:e-core]], [[ref:v-claims|the claims view]], [[ref:e-excl]], [[ref:e-gone]].
